            <title>[LUDOC-577] Add 'gssonly_identification' nodemap property to LOM</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LUDOC-577</link>
                <project id="10070" key="LUDOC">Lustre Documentation</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19079" title="gss for nodemap identification" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19079"&gt;LU-19079&lt;/a&gt; added the 'gssonly_identification' nodemap property. With this property set, the servers identify the clients of a nodemap by their GSS token, not by their NIDs. The Lustre Operations Manual must document this property.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
